<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The New Jerusalem in sight,</l><l>My heart Thy home in Christ,</l><l>Deify me Lord! Deify me Lord!</l><l>Glorious Bride You long to see,</l><l>Conform me unto Thee,</l><l>Deify me Lord! Deify me Lord!</l></lg>
